# Quest names are resolved against the bundled TBC quest database at build time.

@guide A_Human_Elwynn
@name Northshire & Elwynn Forest
@faction Alliance
@races Human
@levels 1-10
@zone Elwynn Forest
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Human starting route. Northshire Valley to level 5, then Goldshire, the Stonefield and Maclure farms, Eastvale and Westbrook. Ends at about level 10, ready for Westfall.
@next A_Westfall

accept A Threat Within
turnin A Threat Within
accept Kobold Camp Cleanup
accept Eagan Peltskinner
turnin Eagan Peltskinner
accept Wolves Across the Border
complete Kobold Camp Cleanup | Kobold Vermin are in the camp just north-west of the abbey.
complete Wolves Across the Border | Kill wolves around the valley for Tough Wolf Meat.
turnin Wolves Across the Border
turnin Kobold Camp Cleanup
accept 3100 Simple Letter [class=Warrior]
accept 3101 Consecrated Letter [class=Paladin]
accept 3102 Encrypted Letter [class=Rogue]
accept 3103 Hallowed Letter [class=Priest]
accept 3104 Glyphic Letter [class=Mage]
