turnin 3105 Tainted Letter [class=Warlock]
train | Learn your level 2-4 abilities while you are here.
turnin Milly Osworth
accept Milly's Harvest
complete Investigate Echo Ridge | Echo Ridge Mine is north of the abbey.
complete Brotherhood of Thieves | Defias Thugs are in the fields east of the abbey.
complete Milly's Harvest | Grape buckets are in the vineyard east of the abbey.
turnin Milly's Harvest
accept Grape Manifest
turnin Investigate Echo Ridge
accept Skirmish at Echo Ridge
turnin Brotherhood of Thieves
accept Bounty on Garrick Padfoot
complete Bounty on Garrick Padfoot [mark=skull] | Garrick Padfoot is at the Defias camp east of the vineyard.
complete Skirmish at Echo Ridge | Kill Kobold Laborers inside Echo Ridge Mine.
turnin Bounty on Garrick Padfoot
turnin Skirmish at Echo Ridge
turnin Grape Manifest | Brother Neals is at the top of the abbey bell tower.
accept Report to Goldshire
train | Level 4 abilities.
accept Rest and Relaxation | Falkhaan Isenstrider stands on the road south of the valley.
turnin Report to Goldshire
accept The Fargodeep Mine
turnin Rest and Relaxation
bind Goldshire
accept Kobold Candles
accept Gold Dust Exchange
accept A Fishy Peril
train | Visit your trainer in Goldshire when you reach level 6.
turnin A Fishy Peril
accept Further Concerns
accept Lost Necklace | "Auntie" Bernice Stonefield is at the Stonefield Farm, south-west of Goldshire.
accept Princess Must Die!
complete The Fargodeep Mine | Explore the Fargodeep Mine entrance south of the farms.
complete Kobold Candles | Kobolds in and around Fargodeep Mine.
complete Gold Dust Exchange | Same kobolds; collect Gold Dust.
turnin Lost Necklace | Billy Maclure is at the Maclure Vineyards.
accept Pie for Billy
accept Young Lovers
complete Pie for Billy | Kill boars around the farms for Chunks of Boar Meat.
turnin Pie for Billy
accept Back to Billy
turnin Young Lovers | Tommy Joe Stonefield is by the stream west of the Stonefield Farm.
accept Speak with Gramma
turnin Speak with Gramma
accept Note to William
turnin Back to Billy
accept Goldtooth
complete Goldtooth | Goldtooth is deep inside Fargodeep Mine (lower level).
turnin Goldtooth
complete Princess Must Die! | Princess is in the Brackwell Pumpkin Patch, south-east of the farms. Bring a friend if you are under level 8.
turnin Princess Must Die!
turnin The Fargodeep Mine
accept The Jasperlode Mine
turnin Kobold Candles
turnin Gold Dust Exchange
turnin Note to William
accept Collecting Kelp
complete Collecting Kelp | Murlocs at Crystal Lake east of Goldshire drop Crystal Kelp Fronds.
turnin Collecting Kelp
accept The Escape
turnin The Escape | Maybell Maclure is at the Maclure Vineyards.
complete The Jasperlode Mine | Explore the Jasperlode Mine, north-east of Goldshire.
turnin Further Concerns | Guard Thomas is on the bridge to Eastvale.
accept Find the Lost Guards
accept Bounty on Murlocs
accept Protect the Frontier
turnin Find the Lost Guards
accept Discover Rolf's Fate
turnin Discover Rolf's Fate
accept Report to Thomas
complete Bounty on Murlocs | Murlocs along the river north of the bridge.
complete Protect the Frontier | Prowlers and young forest bears in Eastvale.
turnin Report to Thomas
accept Deliver Thomas' Report
turnin Bounty on Murlocs
turnin Protect the Frontier
accept Red Linen Goods | Sara Timberlain is at the Eastvale Logging Camp.
accept A Bundle of Trouble
complete Red Linen Goods | Defias around the Eastvale farms drop Red Linen Bandanas.
complete A Bundle of Trouble | Collect Bundles of Wood near the trees of the logging camp.
turnin Red Linen Goods
turnin A Bundle of Trouble
turnin Deliver Thomas' Report
accept Cloth and Leather Armor
turnin The Jasperlode Mine
accept Westbrook Garrison Needs Help!
turnin Westbrook Garrison Needs Help! | Deputy Rainer is at the Westbrook Garrison, west Elwynn.
accept Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty
accept Wanted: "Hogger" [elite; group=3] | The poster is next to Deputy Rainer. Hogger is level 11 elite - group up or skip.
complete Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty | Gnolls south of the garrison drop Painted Gnoll Armbands.
turnin Riverpaw Gnoll Bounty
complete Wanted: "Hogger" [elite; group=3; optional]
turnin Wanted: "Hogger" [optional]
turnin Cloth and Leather Armor | Return to Sara Timberlain only if you are passing Eastvale; otherwise skip.
accept Report to Gryan Stoutmantle | From Marshal Dughan in Goldshire.
level 10 | Grind gnolls near Westbrook if you are short of level 10.
train | Level 10 training (warriors: defensive stance quest; warlocks: Voidwalker quest).
note Head west on the road into Westfall.
